@Catalog_HostAddress = http://localhost:5101

### Все товары
GET {{Catalog_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Товар по id -> 200
GET {{Catalog_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Несуществующий товар -> 404
GET {{Catalog_HostAddress}}/api/products/99
Accept: application/json
